title: "nirs4all-formats"
abstract: >-
  Low-level Rust readers for ~58 NIRS/spectroscopy file-format families (OPUS, JCAMP, SPC, ASD,
  ENVI, OpenSpecy, and more), with Python/R/WASM/C bindings; part of the nirs4all ecosystem.
